Carafe Lab: Eden's GPU path reports where its time goes. Every 10 s the GPU thread logs a "[GPU timing]" line:
time idle waiting for work, guest submissions and their glFlush, composites and their SwapBuffers, the composition
thread's wait for a composite, CPU reads of GPU memory (GPU::OnCPURead), fence waits, and under NCE the faults on
pages the GPU caches (reads that download, writes that invalidate), guest faults and traps. The counters are
relaxed atomics read and reset by the report.
GPL-3.0-or-later, as the files it changes.

